		PlayerIndex:
			Dinosaur: 192, 164, 132, 155, 133, 197, 112, 12, 163, 132, 155, 133, 134, 197, 154, 198
	IndexedPlayerPalette@units:
		PlayerIndex:
			Dinosaur: 192, 164, 132, 155, 133, 197, 112, 12, 163, 132, 155, 133, 134, 197, 154, 198

^CivInfantry:
	-ActorLostNotification:

^CivBuilding:
	AnnounceOnSeen:

