briefing = 
    Take out the Nod turrets along the shore so Gunboats can approach the Nod base.
    
    The Nod base must be destroyed.
    
    If Gunboats can get in, they should be able to destroy the base with ease.
    
    Keep an eye out for the new weapon rumored to be under development.
