briefing = 
    We had set up a small recon post in Nod territory, but they captured and reinforced it.
    
    Getting that post back would be a major coup.
    
    An MCV and armed convoy are on their way to aid you in establishing a new base.
    
    Once established, eliminate all Nod forces in the area.
